    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "S-waves cannot pass through liquids, which directly proves the molten state of the Outer Core.",
        "The Mohorovicic Discontinuity separates the Crust and Mantle, while the Gutenberg Discontinuity separates the Mantle and Core.",
        "P-waves are the fastest seismic waves and can travel through solids, liquids, and gases."
      ],
      "id": "xrq1cfi"
    },
    {
      "id": "ftzq240",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Important Discontinuities"
    },
    {
      "id": "l4a4x0y",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Discontinuity</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Location</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Significance</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Mohorovicic (Moho)</p>",
            "<p>Between crust and mantle</p>",
            "<p>Sharp increase in seismic wave velocity</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Gutenberg</p>",
            "<p>Between mantle and core</p>",
            "<p>Marks boundary of liquid outer core</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Lehmann</p>",
            "<p>Between outer and inner core</p>",
            "<p>Separates liquid and solid core</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "exm65oz",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "o9xv4kl",
      "content": "• Earth's radius is approximately 6371 km."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xy1ycsb",
      "content": "• Mantle is the thickest layer of Earth."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "oa0f5mj",
      "content": "• Outer core is liquid while inner core is solid."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "e2edgoh",
      "content": "• Moho discontinuity separates crust and mantle."
    }
  ],
  "enriched": true
}